    {
      "block": "library/10665-357088/blocks/prose-sec-002",
      "source": "sections/sec-002-executive-summary.md",
      "source_hash": "f49e0cbb0c6e25eab9559fd5b86bbdaea4b9470959f328599d918e05ca1a6f89",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Summarizes the burden of cryptococcal disease in advanced HIV, noting an estimated 181,100 deaths from cryptococcal meningitis in 2014, and explains that these guidelines replace the 2018 edition. It presents the main recommendations on diagnosis, antigen screening, preventive fluconazole and the new preferred induction regimen based on 2021 evidence. The summary also covers consolidation and maintenance treatment, deferred ART, managing raised intracranial pressure and steps for handling relapse.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-357088/blocks/prose-sec-003",
      "source": "sections/sec-003-1-background.md",
      "source_hash": "461056abf5337a230b207f4e23a14291dfad85d5bec2497448c0e9bfce299a75",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Gives the background to cryptococcal disease as an opportunistic infection in advanced HIV, its high mortality especially in low-income countries, and the 2021 trial that prompted the update. It notes that the disease is uncommon in children and mostly presents as meningitis.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-357088/blocks/prose-sec-004",
      "source": "sections/sec-004-11-objectives-and-target-audience.md",
      "source_hash": "56fd2b9a0f07a3dfc9e608578ec0c92a475edc4b26b868009d4c74140b76f9ae",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "States that the guidelines aim to give updated recommendations on treating cryptococcal disease in people with HIV and are intended for programme managers, policy-makers, clinicians and people living with HIV.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
