      "block": "library/10665-357088/blocks/prose-sec-036",
      "source": "sections/sec-036-web-annex-1-declarations-of-interest-for-the-gui.md",
      "source_hash": "68061f090753f109dcede45e19b28739a24f418a4962d4ae0e36c724d44852fd",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Web Annex 1 tabulates declarations of interest for the 15 Guideline Development Group members, with their sex and regional breakdown, and records full participation for those listed. The page ends with the title and authors of Web Annex B, a systematic review and GRADE profile on treatment of HIV-associated cryptococcal meningitis.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
